    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d333">

                <pb facs="0365" n="283" sameAs="frus:frus1911/pg283"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 838.00/589.</note>
                <head>[Untitled]</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1911-07-23"><hi rendition="#small-caps">July</hi> 23,
                        1911</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>The minister is informed by the Haitian Government that it has been decided to
                    blockade Fort Liberté, Gonaives, and St. Marc. He has replied that the blockade
                    must be effective to be respected.</p>
            </div>
